E. PLATFORM PCIe LANE CONSTRAINT  [PROJECTION -- decisive for >12 GiB/s]
==========================================================================
Consumer AM5: CPU-direct = 1x Gen5 x4 M.2 + 1x Gen4 x4 M.2.
Extra M.2 slots hang off the chipset, which shares ONE Gen4 x4 uplink
= 6.719 GiB/s derated TOTAL for all chipset devices.
=> naive '4 drives on the motherboard' does NOT give 4x bandwidth.
WARP runs CPU-only streaming inference: the x16 GPU link is UNUSED.
Bifurcating x16 -> 4x x4 via a passive carrier gives 4 CPU-direct NVMe.

